   "translations": [
    {
     "language_code": "eng",
     "text": [
      "O mind, worship the lotus feet of Śrī Nanda-nandana, which bring fearlessness. This human birth is very rare, so take the association of saintly persons and cross over this ocean of material existence."
     ]
    }
   ],
